WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.400
There's a lot packed into Chilling&nbsp;
Adventures of Sabrina's 36 episodes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.200
Alongside her friends, family, and coven,&nbsp;
Sabrina faces new and ancient threats,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.880
plus saves the world a few times.&nbsp;
Here's the entire timeline of Chilling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.880
Adventures of Sabrina explained, from&nbsp;
pre-show history to the series finale.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:22.560
Hundreds of years ago, a group of Scottish&nbsp;
witches fleeing persecution were taken by boat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:27.600
to Greendale, Massachusetts, by Dorothea Putnam.&nbsp;
But these witches were no safer in Greendale,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.280
and thirteen of them were hunted and&nbsp;
hanged by ancestors of Harvey Kinkle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:36.160
Sabrina's first boyfriend. The Greendale Thirteen&nbsp;
and their coven were the earliest incarnation of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.480
the Church of Night, to which Sabrina's family,&nbsp;
the Spellmans, have belonged for generations.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:44.560
In the first season of Chilling Adventures&nbsp;
of Sabrina, the Thirteen are summoned by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:48.960
demon Lilith to attack the town. This is the&nbsp;
only time Greendale's original witches are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.120
actually present on screen, but their story&nbsp;
informs much of what happens in the Church&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.840
of Night and in Greendale, especially as Sabrina&nbsp;
starts learning more about how to use her magic.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:03.440
When Sabrina Spellman is born, two things&nbsp;
happen: Her aunt Zelda forges her signature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:07.360
in the Book of the Beast, effectively taking&nbsp;
away Sabrina's choice whether to sign when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:12.000
she comes of age as a witch. Her aunt Hilda&nbsp;
also witnesses Sabrina's Christian baptism,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.360
which is strictly forbidden by the&nbsp;
Church of Night. This leads to Hilda&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.840
being excommunicated from the Church. It also&nbsp;
causes friction between Sabrina and Zelda,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:23.600
and complicates Sabrina's decision to&nbsp;
sign the Book of the Beast herself.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.960
Sabrina's parents, Edward, a&nbsp;
warlock, and Diana, a mortal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.520
are killed in a plane crash&nbsp;
when Sabrina is very young.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:35.040
"Your father and mother were flying to Italy.&nbsp;
Edward was giving a lecture at the Vatican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:37.600
when their plane went down. Tragically."

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.680
Originally believed to be an accident, Sabrina&nbsp;
later learns their deaths were calculated by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.400
Father Blackwood, who saw Edward's progressive&nbsp;
ideas as a threat to the Church of Night.

00:01:49.280 --> 00:01:54.080
In the show's pilot, Sabrina's favorite teacher,&nbsp;
Mrs. Wardwell, provides shelter to a distressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:57.920
young girl she finds on the side of the road.&nbsp;
When she brings the girl to her remote cottage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.920 --> 00:02:02.400
Mrs. Wardwell is slain by the girl, who&nbsp;
then assumes her appearance and identity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:06.240
It's revealed that the shapeshifter&nbsp;
girl is Lilith, a demon from Hell.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:11.120
She's come to Greendale to manipulate Sabrina into&nbsp;
signing the Book of the Beast. Lilith believes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.680
this will give her what she wants, which is a&nbsp;
shared reign over Hell with her beloved Lucifer.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.920
Eventually, Lilith reveals her true identity to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.840
Sabrina and the Spellman family and&nbsp;
pretends to be a mentor to Sabrina.

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.960
Sabrina turns sixteen on Halloween night.&nbsp;
Her boyfriend, Harvey, really wants her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:31.120
celebrate with him and their friends, Roz&nbsp;
and Theo. But Sabrina is expected to sign&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:35.280
the Book of the Beast and be fully initiated&nbsp;
in the Church of Night coven. She can't spend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:39.360
her birthday with her friends, and she'll be&nbsp;
expected to leave the mortal world behind.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:44.240
Her aunts allow her to go to Roz's Halloween&nbsp;
party, but she's expected in the woods before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:48.720
midnight to sign her soul over to Satan. While&nbsp;
she's standing in front of the Book of the Beast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:53.040
Sabrina believes that signing her name is a&nbsp;
choice that will allow her to embrace her power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.200
and freely perform magic as a full witch. When&nbsp;
she learns that she'll actually be at the Dark&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:02.560
Lord's beck and call, she panics and runs out of&nbsp;
the woods. The coven follows, but Sabrina's cousin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:07.120
Ambrose prevents them from crossing the Spellman&nbsp;
property line, protecting Sabrina from harm.

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.440
When Lilith summons the Thirteen&nbsp;
to Greendale, it's part of a master&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:15.520
plan to force Sabrina to sign the Book of&nbsp;
the Beast. But by summoning the Thirteen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:19.840
Lilith puts Greendale and the Church of Night&nbsp;
at risk, which means Sabrina is the only one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.080
who can defeat them and save everyone. Sabrina&nbsp;
can't do that without the full use of her magic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:27.360
which she can only acquire by&nbsp;
agreeing to sell her soul to Satan.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:32.400
In the season 1 finale, Sabrina finally puts her&nbsp;
name in the book and becomes a full-blooded witch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:36.080
In Season 2, she starts using magic&nbsp;
more frequently and tells her friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.560
she's a witch. This causes some problems,&nbsp;
particularly in her relationship with Harvey.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:45.200
Sabrina starts attending the Academy of Unseen&nbsp;
Arts more often than she attends Baxter High,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:48.000
and she even starts dating&nbsp;
a warlock, Nick Scratch.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:53.200
With help from Lilith and Nick, Lucifer&nbsp;
Morningstar returns to his human form at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.800
the end of Season 2. He makes several&nbsp;
revelations which alter the course of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:01.120
Sabrina's life and the show. Perhaps the&nbsp;
most important one is that Edward Spellman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:06.880
isn't actually Sabrina's father — Lucifer is.&nbsp;
Sabrina is thus in line to become Queen of Hell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:12.000
and Lucifer needs her to rule alongside him&nbsp;
so they can remake Earth in Hell's image. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.400
also needs Sabrina to blow the Horn of Gabriel to&nbsp;
open the gates of Hell, which will allow the dark&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:21.680
aristocracy to attend her coronation on Earth.&nbsp;
Sabrina refuses, but Lucifer isn't concerned.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:27.040
"You will blow Gabriel's horn at sundown&nbsp;
in the clearing where you signed my book."

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:32.640
Lilith, meanwhile, is furious about Lucifer's&nbsp;
betrayal, so she turns on him and begins working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:36.800
with Sabrina to stop the Dark Lord's&nbsp;
plan. All Lilith wants is the throne,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:40.480
and all Sabrina wants is to continue&nbsp;
being a mostly regular teenager.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:46.240
With Lilith's help, Sabrina attempts to trap&nbsp;
and imprison Lucifer so he doesn't destroy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:51.200
Earth. But they soon realize the only way to&nbsp;
trap Lucifer is to put him in a human body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:56.000
Nick, Sabrina's boyfriend, is the most powerful&nbsp;
conjurer and binder since Edward Spellman.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:59.760
As an apology to Sabrina for initially&nbsp;
befriending her on the Dark Lord's behalf,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.240
Nick volunteers to become the vessel&nbsp;
and keep Lucifer contained. This traps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:08.960
him in Hell with Lucifer in his body, and he&nbsp;
suffers intense trauma from the experience.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:12.160
Sabrina then abdicates the throne&nbsp;
and makes Lilith Queen of Hell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:16.400
which is all Lilith ever wanted. In&nbsp;
exchange, Lilith restores Sabrina's magic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:20.400
which she lost for defying Lucifer, and&nbsp;
resurrects the actual Mrs. Wardwell.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:25.680
While Sabrina deals with Lucifer in Season&nbsp;
2, Prudence learns she's Father Blackwood's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:30.320
biological daughter. Blackwood's multiple attempts&nbsp;
to return the Church of Night to its old ways end&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:35.840
with him being scolded and punished by Lucifer,&nbsp;
so he takes his infant twins and flees. Prudence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:40.240
and Ambrose go on a worldwide hunt to find&nbsp;
her father. When they find him in Scotland,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:44.720
they discover he's manipulated time&nbsp;
to age both himself and the twins up.

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:49.200
Blackwood then becomes a prisoner of the coven,&nbsp;
and Sabrina's aunt Zelda becomes the new High&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:54.880
Priestess. The coven then turns to Hecate for&nbsp;
power, leaving Lucifer behind completely. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:59.120
Sabrina frees Lucifer from Nick's body,&nbsp;
she imprisons him in Blackwood's body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:03.040
though he doesn't stay confined for long.&nbsp;
The hunt for Blackwood ultimately damages&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:07.680
Prudence's relationship with Ambrose, who&nbsp;
asked her not to seek vengeance on her father.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:12.560
When the aristocracy of Hell decides&nbsp;
Lilith isn't a legitimate queen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:17.200
Sabrina has to take her rightful place on the&nbsp;
throne, all while balancing her life on Earth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:21.760
But the aristocracy also doesn't recognize&nbsp;
Sabrina as a legitimate heir to the throne.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:27.040
They instead support Prince Caliban, a clay&nbsp;
demon formed from Hell. Caliban and Sabrina&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:31.760
compete for the throne in a series of challenges&nbsp;
known as the Unholy Regalia. This requires&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:37.200
them to go back in time, acquire certain holy&nbsp;
objects, battle monsters, and fight each other.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:41.920
Caliban nearly wins by tricking Sabrina into&nbsp;
giving him the final object needed to claim the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:47.040
throne. Sabrina then creates a time paradox when&nbsp;
she realizes her attention to the Holy Regalia has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:52.400
doomed the world to end. With the paradox, she's&nbsp;
able to stop Caliban and become the Queen of Hell.

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:58.000
Shortly after Nick becomes Lucifer's vessel&nbsp;
and Sabrina gives Lilith the throne of Hell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:02.720
a group of Pagans arrives in Greendale. They&nbsp;
are determined to return the world to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:06.240
Old Ones, which means sacrificing&nbsp;
virgins to awaken the Green Man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:09.440
and end the modern world. The&nbsp;
Pagans disguise themselves as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:13.600
carnival performers and attempt to seduce&nbsp;
Sabrina's friends into being sacrificed.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:18.400
In the end stages of the Pagans' plan, Sabrina&nbsp;
is too caught up in the Holy Regalia to realize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:22.560
how desperately her friends need her help.&nbsp;
Before she figures out how to go back in time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:26.320
Sabrina gets trapped in Hell, and&nbsp;
the Pagans kill her friends. Luckily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:30.720
using a "time egg" recovered from Father&nbsp;
Blackwood in Scotland allows Sabrina to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:35.200
stop the Pagans and save the world, though she&nbsp;
creates a new set of problems in the process.

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:37.440
"What am I?"

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:42.400
To prevent the Pagans from winning and&nbsp;
stop Caliban from becoming King of Hell,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:47.360
Sabrina is forced to manipulate time. The&nbsp;
version of her that's trapped in clay in Hell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.840
is awoken by a different version, who has&nbsp;
already fixed everything. This version of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:56.400
Sabrina tells the trapped version that she&nbsp;
must close the time loop by returning to Hell&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:01.520
and trading places with her to stop the massive&nbsp;
ramifications. In classic Sabrina Spellman style,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:06.320
she ignores this advice and instead decides that&nbsp;
life would be easier if there were two of her.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:11.600
So Sabrina Spellman returns to Earth while Sabrina&nbsp;
Morningstar remains in Hell and is crowned queen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:16.880
Morningstar marries Cailban and contentedly rules&nbsp;
over Hell with Lucifer and Lilith, doing all of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:21.040
the things Spellman didn't want to do. When&nbsp;
Ambrose discovers what his cousin has done,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:25.520
he forbids her from ever being in the same place&nbsp;
as Sabrina Morningstar again. Sabrina Spellman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:30.160
abides until she needs Morningstar's help,&nbsp;
which, you guessed it, causes major problems.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.600
After he leaves the Church of Night, acts as a&nbsp;
vessel for Lucifer, and is then given the Mark&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:41.120
of Cain so he can't be killed, Faustus Blackwood&nbsp;
decides to unleash the Eldritch Terrors, gods so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.600
ancient they haven't been seen in thousands&nbsp;
of years. Of course, they want to end the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:50.320
world. This power play is spurred by Blackwood's&nbsp;
anger at the Spellmans, particularly Sabrina,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:54.960
and he seems to think he'll somehow be spared&nbsp;
when the Eldritch Terrors destroy everything.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:59.680
Sabrina and her family are able to beat back the&nbsp;
Eldritch Terrors at first, even when Blackwood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:05.360
uses the Perverse to become Emperor of Greendale&nbsp;
and rewrite reality. However, stopping the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.360 --> 00:09:10.400
powerful Terror, The Void, requires a powerful&nbsp;
witch or warlock to sacrifice themselves.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:16.080
The Cosmic is the first Eldritch Horror not&nbsp;
to manifest in Greendale itself. Instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:20.720
it begins to condense Hell, Earth, and Heaven&nbsp;
until they bleed together, which ultimately&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:26.000
leads to chaos. An angel, Metatron, then arrives&nbsp;
in Greendale and tells the coven that this chaos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:31.520
is the result of there being two Sabrinas. Their&nbsp;
continued existence has created a parallel cosmos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.920
which is being pulled toward Earth. To stop&nbsp;
the inevitable collision and The Cosmic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.040
one of the Sabrinas must be&nbsp;
sent to an alternate Earth.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:44.080
Sabrinas Spellman and Morningstar both have lives&nbsp;
on Earth, so they decide that the fairest way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:48.560
determine who stays and who goes is to play&nbsp;
Rock, Paper, Scissors. Morningstar loses, so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:53.680
she's sent away. On the alternate Earth, she's an&nbsp;
actor playing herself in a TV sitcom of her life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:58.240
surrounded by her family and friends who are also&nbsp;
playing versions of themselves. But The Endless,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:03.200
in the form of an animatronic Salem, has&nbsp;
turned this realm into a never-ending sitcom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:06.000
for its own amusement. Like&nbsp;
the other Eldritch Terrors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.480
The Endless is working for The Void. Sabrina&nbsp;
Morningstar realizes the problem and returns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:14.480
to the main Earth to warn Sabrina Spellman,&nbsp;
then dies from the trip through realms.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.720
In a last-ditch effort to&nbsp;
keep Lucifer from killing her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.760
Lilith convinces Blackwood to sleep with her while&nbsp;
he's Lucifer's vessel so she'll become pregnant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:28.640
with Lucifer's child. Lilith intends to use&nbsp;
her child as a means of becoming Queen of Hell.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:33.040
She schemes that her child can kill Lucifer&nbsp;
to claim the throne to make her Queen Mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:38.480
When Lucifer tries to take the child from her,&nbsp;
she kills the boy herself and makes a meal of him.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:43.440
Lilith's final act in the series finale is&nbsp;
to stab Lucifer, drink his celestial blood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:47.840
and then banish him to wander the mortal&nbsp;
world so she can rule Hell in peace.

00:10:48.800 --> 00:10:52.800
Throughout Chilling Adventures of Sabrina&nbsp;
season 4, the coven works with hedge witches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:56.960
to try and stop the Eldritch Terrors. They&nbsp;
quickly realize they're out of their depth,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.400
so Sabrina Spellman tries to solve&nbsp;
the problem by trapping The Void in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:04.800
Pandora's Box. That unfortunately&nbsp;
requires her to sacrifice herself.

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:09.280
Her family isn't willing to let her go, so they&nbsp;
summon her spirit back to Sabrina Morningstar's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:14.480
body, which creates a war between Hell and&nbsp;
Earth. Spellman realizes she's taken part of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:19.840
Void into herself when she starts disappearing&nbsp;
random objects, Caliban, and Harvey's father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:24.080
She fears hurting her loved ones, so she flees&nbsp;
to the Mountains of Madness where Faustus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:28.800
Blackwood claims he can train her to contain&nbsp;
The Void. Blackwood secretly plans to rip The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:33.440
Void from Sabrina's body to claim the power for&nbsp;
himself. Sabrina's friends attempt to save her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:38.720
but returning the people Sabrina accidentally&nbsp;
disappeared requires Zelda to cut Sabrina open&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:44.000
and drain The Void from her body. This opens a&nbsp;
gateway, allowing Ambrose and Harvey to put the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:48.880
Eldritch Terrors they've trapped inside The Void,&nbsp;
and retrieve the people. Once everyone has been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:54.720
returned from The Void, Nick uses Pandora's Box&nbsp;
to trap The Void forever. Sabrina doesn't survive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:58.800
and her family mourns both her and&nbsp;
Sabrina Morningstar back in Greendale.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.800
Chilling Adventures of Sabrina ends with&nbsp;
Sabrina and Nick in the Sweet Hereafter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:07.120
which is a much friendlier afterlife than any&nbsp;
others that have been shown in the series.

